        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Diagrama de Colaboración: Inicio de Sesión\nskinparam linestyle ortho\nallow_mixing\n\nactor \&quot;:Usuario\&quot; as User\nobject \&quot;:LoginController\&quot; as Ctrl\nobject \&quot;:UserDAO\&quot; as DAO\nobject \&quot;:SessionController\&quot; as Session\nobject \&quot;:LoginView\&quot; as View\n\nUser -right-&gt; Ctrl : 1: login(user, pass)\nCtrl -down-&gt; DAO : 2: findByUsername(user)\nDAO -up-&gt; Ctrl : 3: return UserData\nCtrl -right-&gt; Session : 4: startSession(userId, rol)\nCtrl -down-&gt; View : 5: render(dashboard)\n\nnote right of Session\n  El SessionController mantiene\n  el estado del usuario actual\nend note\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="6nIE37M3ZvMtP2BfBP-6-2">
