        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Diagrama de Colaboración: Creación de Producto\nskinparam linestyle ortho\nallow_mixing\n\nactor \&quot;:Gerente\&quot; as User\nobject \&quot;:ProductoController\&quot; as Ctrl\nobject \&quot;:GerenteService\&quot; as Service\nobject \&quot;:ProductoDAO\&quot; as DAO\nobject \&quot;:DbConnection\&quot; as DB\nobject \&quot;:ProductoFormView\&quot; as View\n\nUser -right-&gt; Ctrl : 1: crear(dto)\nCtrl -right-&gt; Service : 2: crearProducto(dto)\nService -down-&gt; DAO : 3: create(dto)\nDAO -right-&gt; DB : 4: getConnection()\nDAO -up-&gt; Service : 5: return ID\nService -left-&gt; Ctrl : 6: return success\nCtrl -down-&gt; View : 7: showList()\n\nnote bottom of Service\n  El Servicio encapsula la\n  regla de negocio antes\n  de llamar a persistencia\nend note\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="6nIE37M3ZvMtP2BfBP-6-3">
