        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Diagrama de Colaboración: Confirmar Producción y Alerta de Stock\nskinparam linestyle ortho\nallow_mixing\n\nactor \&quot;:Cocinero\&quot; as User\nobject \&quot;:CocineroController\&quot; as Ctrl\nobject \&quot;:CocineroService\&quot; as Service\nobject \&quot;:ProductoDAO\&quot; as DAO\nobject \&quot;:StockTeoricoStrategy\&quot; as Strategy\nobject \&quot;:StockAlertManager\&quot; as Subject\nobject \&quot;:GerenteStockObserver\&quot; as Observer\nobject \&quot;:ProductosListView\&quot; as UI\n\nUser -right-&gt; Ctrl : 1: confirmarProduccion(idVenta, cant)\nCtrl -right-&gt; Service : 2: confirmarProduccion(...)\nService -down-&gt; DAO : 3: updateCantidad(id, -cant)\nService -down-&gt; Strategy : 4: calcular(idProducto)\nStrategy -up-&gt; Service : 5: return stockActual\nService -right-&gt; Subject : 6: checkStock(id)\n\nSubject -right-&gt; Subject : 7: notifyStockBajo()\nSubject -down-&gt; Observer : 8: onStockBajo(id, cant, min)\nObserver -left-&gt; UI : 9: applyDecorator(view)\n\nnote right of Observer\n  El Observer notifica a la UI\n  para resaltar el producto\n  con StockBajoDecorator\nend note\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="6nIE37M3ZvMtP2BfBP-6-4">
