        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Diagrama de Colaboración: Recepción de Pedido a Proveedor\nskinparam linestyle ortho\nallow_mixing\n\nactor \&quot;:Gerente\&quot; as User\nobject \&quot;:PedidosController\&quot; as Ctrl\nobject \&quot;:GerenteService\&quot; as Service\nobject \&quot;:PedidosDAO\&quot; as DaoPed\nobject \&quot;:ProductoDAO\&quot; as DaoProd\nobject \&quot;:PedidoFormView\&quot; as View\n\nUser -right-&gt; Ctrl : 1: marcarRecibido(idPedido)\nCtrl -right-&gt; Service : 2: marcarPedidoRecibido(id)\nService -down-&gt; DaoPed : 3: getById(id)\nDaoPed -up-&gt; Service : 4: return DetallePedido\nService -down-&gt; DaoPed : 5: update(estado=&#39;Recibido&#39;)\nService -down-&gt; DaoProd : 6: updateCantidad(idProd, +cant)\nService -left-&gt; Ctrl : 7: return success\nCtrl -down-&gt; View : 8: showSuccess(\&quot;Stock actualizado\&quot;)\n\nnote bottom of Service\n  El Servicio coordina dos DAOs:\n  actualiza el estado del pedido\n  e incrementa el stock del producto\nend note\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="6nIE37M3ZvMtP2BfBP-6-5">
