        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Diagrama de Colaboración: Inicialización (Factory Pattern)\nskinparam linestyle ortho\nallow_mixing\n\nactor \&quot;Main / App\&quot; as Main\nobject \&quot;:ControllerFactory\&quot; as CtrlFactory\nobject \&quot;:ViewFactory\&quot; as ViewFactory\nobject \&quot;:LoginController\&quot; as LoginCtrl\nobject \&quot;:LoginView\&quot; as LoginView\n\nMain -right-&gt; CtrlFactory : 1: createLoginController()\nCtrlFactory -down-&gt; ViewFactory : 2: createLoginView()\nViewFactory -up-&gt; CtrlFactory : 3: return LoginView\nCtrlFactory -right-&gt; LoginCtrl : 4: new(LoginView, Service)\nCtrlFactory -up-&gt; Main : 5: return LoginCtrl\n\nnote bottom of CtrlFactory\n  La Factory ensambla el controlador\n  inyectándole la vista y los servicios\n  necesarios automáticamente.\nend note\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="6nIE37M3ZvMtP2BfBP-6-7">
