        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\ntitle Diagrama de Colaboración: Generación de Informes\nallow_mixing\n\n&#39; Estilos para mejorar la legibilidad\nskinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEFFDD\nskinparam noteBorderColor #D6A620\nskinparam ArrowColor #333333\n\nactor \&quot;:Gerente\&quot; as User\n\n\n    object \&quot;:InformesController\&quot; as Ctrl\n    object \&quot;:InformesDashboardView\&quot; as View\n\n    object \&quot;:GerenteService\&quot; as Service\n\n\n    object \&quot;:InformesDAO\&quot; as DAO\n    object \&quot;:DbConnection\&quot; as DB\n\n\n&#39; Flujo principal (Ida)\nUser -right-&gt; Ctrl : 1: generarMovimientos(desde, hasta)\nCtrl -right-&gt; Service : 2: generarInformeMovimientos(...)\nService -down-&gt; DAO : 3: getAll(filtros)\nDAO -right-&gt; DB : 4: executeQuery()\n\n&#39; Flujo de retorno (Vuelta)\nDAO .up.&gt; Service : 5: return List&lt;Movimientos&gt;\nService .left.&gt; Ctrl : 6: return DatosProcesados\n\n&#39; Renderizado final\nCtrl -down-&gt; View : 7: render(graficos)\n\n&#39; Nota reubicada para evitar superposición\nnote bottom of DAO\n  Aquí se extrae la data cruda\n  para que el Servicio la procese\nend note\n\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="6nIE37M3ZvMtP2BfBP-6-8">
